{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FALCONER:</strong> <strong>Experience the ancient art of falconry</strong> in a vast, open-world setting designed for relaxation and discovery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136600/extras/cd2e7029cd28bc9100cd562e5a7f7269.avif?t=1763600095\" width=1560 height=492 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't just a hunter\u2014you are part of a team. Command your loyal <strong>English Setter</strong> to track and flush prey from the undergrowth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136600/extras/63bff323d0f417518262869ebfa093c9.avif?t=1763600095\" width=1560 height=496 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, watch the skies as your magnificent <strong>hawk</strong> dives in a breathtaking chase. Perfect for players seeking a peaceful, single-player experience with a unique and rewarding gameplay loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4136600?t=1763600095","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4136600?t=1763600095","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136600/ddd2c7631f5115342c3c8395154ca546892d117c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763600095","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136600/ddd2c7631f5115342c3c8395154ca546892d117c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763600095","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FALCONER:</strong> <strong>Experience the ancient art of falconry</strong> in a vast, open-w